    <string name="cfg_shadow_curve_hint" formatted="false">Range = how far the shadow is visible, i.e. how much the picture shrinks on each side. Tightness = how solid the edge is: 0.55 matches the reference (about two thirds of full strength); lower (down to negative) is fainter and longer-tailed, higher (1.2+) is tighter and harder. The tail is cut at 1/255, so there is never a visible outer edge.</string>
